+BLOCKED. Exact teardown product `12112` is referenced by live pending subscription `27527`, pending HPOS order `27511`, and customer `469`. Those three records are outside task 119's published 49-subscription, 150-order, and 22-user deletion allowlists. Deleting product `12112` would leave an unallowlisted subscription referencing a deleted product and would violate both the preserve-everything-else contract and task 119's zero-orphan assertion.
