+BLOCKED. Task-owned product candidate `12112` is referenced by live pending subscription `27527`, pending HPOS order `27511`, and customer `469`. Those three records are outside the 49-subscription, 150-order, and 22-user candidate sets enumerated during D13. Deleting product `12112` would leave an out-of-scope subscription referencing a deleted product and would violate both the preserve-everything-else contract and task 119's zero-orphan assertion.
+
+This finding does not authorize cancellation, deletion, reassignment, migration, or candidate-set expansion for IDs `469`, `27511`, or `27527`. They were preserved.
+
+## Affected records
+
+- Task-owned product candidate: `12112`, published `SLT Paddle Daily`.
+- Excluded subscription: `27527`, `arraysubs-pending`, product `12112`, customer/author `469`, parent order `27511`, next payment `2026-08-16 09:28:10` UTC, completed payments `0`, recurring amount USD `11.00`.
